<title>UK: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davis Cup results on Friday:</p>
<p>Euro/African zone, group two playoff:</p>
<p>In Tbilisi, Georgia lead Nigeria 2-0</p>
<p>David Kacharava  beat Jean-Louis Abelekan  6-1 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Vladimir Gabrichidze  beat Sule Ladipo  6-3 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Euro/African zone group two play-offs</p>
<p>In Riga: Latvia lead Ghana 2-0</p>
<p>Girt Zelde beat Ginter Darkey 6-2 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Andrei Filimonov beat Frank Ofori 6-1 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Asia/Oceania zone group one play-off</p>
<p>In Tashkent: Uzbekistan and Japan level 1-1</p>
<p>Oleg Ogorodov (Uzbekistan) beat Hideki Kaneko (Japan) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>4-6</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Goichi Motomura (Japan) beat Dmitry Tomashevich (Uzbekistan)</p>
<p>6-1 2-6 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>In Kiev: Ukraine and Britain level 1-1</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) beat Andrei Rybalko (Ukraine) 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat Greg Rusedski (Britain) 6-1</p>
<p>6-1 2-6 6-2</p>
</text>
